      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The case of a 20-year-old diabetic male with 2 weeks of hip pain, diagnosed with an isolated obturator externus muscle abscess, is reported. Pyomyositis, or abscess formation deep within a large striated muscle, is a rare but potentially life-threatening disease."},
